WEBVTT

00:14.014 --> 00:17.559
SOMEWHERE IN TOKYO IN THE '80S

00:17.642 --> 00:19.936
ANYTHING GOES
MARTIAL ARTS TENDO DOJO

00:21.146 --> 00:22.230
Mr. Tendo.

00:22.313 --> 00:23.314
Hello there.

00:24.691 --> 00:26.234
- Mail for you.
- Thank you.

00:31.322 --> 00:33.950
<i>Cutting to the chase, I'm bringing Ranma.</i>

00:34.034 --> 00:35.410
<i>From China.</i>

00:35.493 --> 00:37.412
<i>From Genma.</i>

00:42.667 --> 00:45.211
Ranma is coming.

00:46.379 --> 00:49.966
I've waited so long for this day.

00:58.308 --> 01:02.562
RANMA1/2

02:24.561 --> 02:25.770
HERE'S RANMA

02:25.854 --> 02:29.399
Hey! Kasumi, Nabiki, Akane!

02:30.233 --> 02:31.317
Kasumi.

02:32.026 --> 02:33.778
Yes, Dad?

02:35.155 --> 02:36.406
Hey, Nabiki!

02:37.031 --> 02:38.032
What's up?

02:39.659 --> 02:40.660
Akane!

02:44.414 --> 02:46.082
Isn't she home?

02:46.166 --> 02:47.792
She's probably out training.

02:53.882 --> 02:56.301
TENDO DOJO

02:57.677 --> 02:58.720
I'm back.

03:16.362 --> 03:17.906
Never felt better.

03:17.989 --> 03:19.490
You're back at it again?

03:19.574 --> 03:22.327
Keep this up,
and boys will never ask you out.

03:22.410 --> 03:23.661
Mind your own business.

03:24.162 --> 03:27.957
Nabiki, unlike you, I can't stand boys!

03:28.041 --> 03:29.042
Oh, really?

03:29.125 --> 03:32.420
Then you won't be interested
in what I have to say.

03:33.046 --> 03:34.047
Huh?

03:44.349 --> 03:45.808
Fiancé?

03:45.892 --> 03:48.937
Yes. He's the son
of a dear friend of mine.

03:49.437 --> 03:51.189
His name is Ranma Saotome.

03:51.731 --> 03:54.734
The Tendo family will be secure
if one of you three

03:54.817 --> 03:58.655
marry Ranma and continue running the dojo.

03:59.364 --> 04:01.699
Wait just a minute.

04:01.783 --> 04:05.286
You can't decide that for us.
I'm not gonna marry some random.

04:05.370 --> 04:08.456
I'm uneasy about this too.
We've never even met him.

04:09.582 --> 04:11.960
Well, you'll meet him soon enough.

04:34.023 --> 04:38.194
You better knock it off!

04:44.867 --> 04:46.619
- A panda.
- There's a panda.

04:52.125 --> 04:54.377
- A panda!
- Absolutely a panda!

04:59.882 --> 05:01.134
Bring it.

05:23.740 --> 05:26.909
How's that? Bet that one hurt.

05:30.913 --> 05:34.292
Ha! Struggling to get back on your feet?
Don't push yourself too hard.

05:36.085 --> 05:41.132
I never agreed to do it!

05:41.758 --> 05:44.010
You can't just decide

05:44.093 --> 05:47.055
whom I marry!

05:54.562 --> 05:56.606
I'm going back to China.

05:57.106 --> 05:59.400
You stay like that
for the rest of your life.

06:16.626 --> 06:19.212
- It's taking the girl.
- But it's a panda.

06:22.423 --> 06:26.302
The Saotome father and son go on journeys
to sharpen their martial arts skills.

06:26.385 --> 06:29.138
They crossed into China
on their latest trip.

06:29.639 --> 06:31.557
China, really?

06:31.641 --> 06:33.935
It doesn't mean that he is strong.

06:34.018 --> 06:35.019
Is Ranma handsome?

06:35.103 --> 06:37.647
How old is he?
I won't marry a younger man.

06:39.899 --> 06:41.818
- What's he like?
- What's he like?

06:42.401 --> 06:43.402
No idea.

06:43.903 --> 06:45.530
- Do you know anything?
- Nope.

06:45.613 --> 06:46.614
Not even a little?

06:46.697 --> 06:48.032
I've never even met him.

06:48.533 --> 06:49.534
- Seriously?
- Dead serious.

06:49.617 --> 06:51.536
Let me go!

06:51.619 --> 06:55.581
I said let me go, fuzz brain!
Get your filthy hands off me!

06:55.665 --> 06:58.042
I refuse to do this!

06:58.126 --> 07:01.087
Why don't you say something, huh?

07:02.130 --> 07:03.548
Right, pandas can't even talk.

07:04.298 --> 07:05.299
Gross.

07:05.383 --> 07:06.634
Damn it!

07:07.218 --> 07:08.219
We have company.

07:08.302 --> 07:09.470
Let go!

07:10.179 --> 07:12.140
That's got to be Ranma!

07:12.223 --> 07:13.641
I've waited for this, Genma!

07:14.767 --> 07:16.144
Nabiki...

07:16.227 --> 07:18.354
For now, let's go and welcome them.

07:18.938 --> 07:20.690
<i>I hope he's older than me.</i>

07:20.773 --> 07:22.859
<i>Geez, I already hate this.</i>

07:28.156 --> 07:30.158
Hey, is something wrong?

07:30.950 --> 07:31.951
Huh?

07:38.374 --> 07:39.625
Why is there a panda?

07:39.709 --> 07:42.753
See? You're scaring them. I said let go!

07:42.837 --> 07:44.755
Is this your friend?

07:45.756 --> 07:48.885
If they aren't your friends,
then why is there a panda here?

07:50.136 --> 07:51.262
This isn't normal!

07:59.854 --> 08:01.731
Might you be...

08:03.733 --> 08:06.235
I'm Ranma Saotome.

08:06.819 --> 08:08.863
Oh, you're Ranma.

08:08.946 --> 08:10.781
Aw, what a cutie.

08:10.865 --> 08:13.659
I'm very happy you came.

08:14.327 --> 08:17.997
I waited for years
to finally meet you like this.

08:19.165 --> 08:22.418
When Genma told me
that he had a son, you know,

08:22.502 --> 08:24.086
I... huh?

08:36.724 --> 08:38.976
Hey, can you please stop?

08:40.478 --> 08:41.854
She's totally a girl.

08:46.609 --> 08:49.362
You were really disappointed, Dad.

08:49.445 --> 08:52.823
We're the ones disappointed.
You said we had a fiancé.

08:52.907 --> 08:55.910
Don't be like that, Nabiki.
They came all this way for us.

08:55.993 --> 08:59.038
Dad, this is your fault
for not double-checking.

08:59.121 --> 09:01.249
But he said they had a baby boy!

09:01.332 --> 09:03.876
Then explain these! How is she a boy?

09:03.960 --> 09:06.045
Can you stop, please?

09:07.672 --> 09:10.424
Say, do you want to go
look around the dojo?

09:10.508 --> 09:11.592
I'm Akane.

09:12.093 --> 09:13.261
Let's be friends.

09:17.348 --> 09:20.518
I heard about you. Don't you use kung fu?

09:20.601 --> 09:21.936
Yes, a little.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.772
- Why don't we spar for a bit?
- What?

09:24.855 --> 09:26.190
It's only for fun.

09:26.691 --> 09:27.733
Sure...

09:27.817 --> 09:30.027
Don't worry. I'll go easy on you.

09:30.945 --> 09:31.946
You mean it?

09:32.989 --> 09:34.240
Pleased to spar with you.

09:38.286 --> 09:42.790
<i>Is she... wide open? Or...</i>

09:54.719 --> 09:57.096
What's the matter? Come on, hit me!

10:02.059 --> 10:04.562
<i>I can't hit her. She's dodging everything.</i>

10:05.271 --> 10:06.564
<i>No more holding back.</i>

10:06.647 --> 10:08.190
Here I come.

10:27.793 --> 10:29.003
You're pretty good.

10:29.629 --> 10:33.215
No wonder. You traveled
to refine your fighting skills, after all.

10:33.799 --> 10:35.092
Yeah, I'm annoyed.

10:37.053 --> 10:38.763
But at least you are a girl.

10:38.846 --> 10:39.930
Huh?

10:40.014 --> 10:41.098
You know, I...

10:42.350 --> 10:44.769
don't ever want to be beaten by a boy.

11:08.084 --> 11:10.628
Kasumi, who is that old man?

11:10.711 --> 11:13.631
Not sure. I didn't notice him coming in.

11:13.714 --> 11:14.715
Interesting.

11:15.299 --> 11:17.301
- Hey, Ranma.
- Yes?

11:17.385 --> 11:18.886
Why don't you go have a bath?

11:18.969 --> 11:20.596
O-Oh, no thanks.

11:20.679 --> 11:24.183
That won't do.
You're sweaty from all the exercise.

11:24.266 --> 11:27.061
And you said you got rained on.
Go take a bath.

11:27.561 --> 11:28.729
All right.

11:34.652 --> 11:35.820
That's icy!

11:37.113 --> 11:39.365
What do I do?

11:43.160 --> 11:44.370
Sorry, coming through.

11:44.453 --> 11:47.289
At it again? You're drenched in sweat.

11:47.373 --> 11:48.374
Leave me alone.

11:48.457 --> 11:49.708
The bath is ready.

11:49.792 --> 11:50.960
Okay.

11:52.378 --> 11:54.630
Man, what am I gonna do?

12:00.761 --> 12:03.431
She's right. I am soaked.

12:04.974 --> 12:07.643
<i>It'll come to light eventually. Oh well.</i>

12:10.229 --> 12:11.605
<i>I'll get out like this.</i>

12:42.928 --> 12:44.263
Akane?

12:47.808 --> 12:53.564
I'm gonna drown him
at the bottom of the tub with this!

12:54.148 --> 12:56.609
Why are you hauling that around, Akane?

12:57.234 --> 12:59.820
There's a pervert in the bathroom!

13:00.529 --> 13:02.865
Just beat him up with your fists.

13:02.948 --> 13:04.492
No way. I'm way too scared.

13:05.159 --> 13:09.163
That makes no sense.
Ranma is in the bath right now.

13:09.246 --> 13:10.873
- Hey...
- Huh?

13:12.583 --> 13:13.792
Who...

13:14.752 --> 13:16.045
are you?

13:16.128 --> 13:17.129
So...

13:19.340 --> 13:21.425
I'm Ranma Saotome.

13:22.259 --> 13:23.302
I'm sorry.

13:24.053 --> 13:25.054
What?

13:25.638 --> 13:26.931
What's happening?

13:28.182 --> 13:30.559
I'll introduce them one more time.

13:30.643 --> 13:33.521
This is my treasured friend.

13:34.021 --> 13:36.982
Name's Genma Saotome. And this is my son.

13:37.066 --> 13:38.067
I'm Ranma.

13:44.782 --> 13:47.076
Hey, care to explain yourself?

13:47.159 --> 13:49.703
Are you really the girl from earlier?

13:49.787 --> 13:51.872
It's only natural that you are confused.

13:52.414 --> 13:55.459
It's that... Where do even I begin?

13:56.252 --> 13:57.419
For starters...

14:00.965 --> 14:02.258
What?

14:04.343 --> 14:06.011
Why did you do that?

14:08.264 --> 14:09.682
He turned into a girl.

14:11.058 --> 14:15.187
He may be my son, but every time I see it,
it's unfathomably bizarre and uncanny.

14:15.271 --> 14:16.272
You old fart!

14:19.358 --> 14:21.110
Who's bizarre now?

14:21.902 --> 14:23.779
You're the one who's bizarre.

14:24.363 --> 14:27.366
Your friends are strange, Dad.

14:27.449 --> 14:30.536
I don't know much yet.

14:31.203 --> 14:36.041
I did hear they underwent a terrifying
and dangerous training in China.

14:39.211 --> 14:43.299
Sit tight. This will take a while.
It happened two weeks ago.

14:43.382 --> 14:44.383
That's pretty recent.

14:45.885 --> 14:49.054
<i>Bayan Har Mountains, Qinghai, China.</i>

14:49.138 --> 14:51.473
<i>There's a place called
Spirit of the Fist Mountain.</i>

14:52.766 --> 14:54.476
Here we are, sir.

14:55.102 --> 14:58.314
This is the legendary
training ground, Jusenkyo.

15:00.274 --> 15:02.109
You sure are an oddball.

15:02.192 --> 15:06.280
This training ground is too dangerous.
No one uses it anymore.

15:06.363 --> 15:08.657
Have you braced yourself?

15:08.741 --> 15:10.659
There's nothing special to this place.

15:10.743 --> 15:13.746
Over a hundred natural springs form
up here.

15:13.829 --> 15:17.541
Each spring has a tragic legend.

15:17.625 --> 15:20.878
Take that one, for example.
A thousand years ago--

15:20.961 --> 15:22.504
- Follow me!
- You got it.

15:23.339 --> 15:25.382
What are you two doing?

15:25.466 --> 15:27.051
I won't show any mercy.

15:27.134 --> 15:28.260
Didn't ask you to!

15:28.344 --> 15:31.889
You can't do that! Once you
fall into the spring, you're doomed!

15:53.744 --> 15:54.828
Got you!

15:55.412 --> 15:58.040
What's the matter Old Man?
Tapping out already?

16:05.464 --> 16:07.299
Huh? What's this?

16:08.258 --> 16:09.301
A panda?

16:09.385 --> 16:12.221
That's the Spring of Drowned Panda.

16:12.304 --> 16:16.558
Legend goes that 2,000 years ago,
a panda tragically drowned in that spring.

16:17.142 --> 16:21.605
Since then, anyone who falls in it
transforms into a panda! It's cursed!

16:25.025 --> 16:26.777
Give me a second!

16:26.860 --> 16:30.155
I wasn't warned about this!

16:35.911 --> 16:39.498
And there he goes!
That's the Spring of Drowned Girl.

16:39.581 --> 16:42.835
There's a tragic legend
that a young girl drowned

16:42.918 --> 16:44.837
in this spring 1,500 years ago.

16:44.920 --> 16:47.339
Since then, anyone who falls
in this spring

16:47.423 --> 16:50.509
turns into a girl. It's cursed!

16:55.389 --> 16:57.516
See that? He's a girl now!

17:09.111 --> 17:12.114
A legendary training ground, Jusenkyo.

17:12.823 --> 17:15.659
Its true terror
was veiled in mystery until...

17:17.494 --> 17:20.289
What's this about its true terror?

17:20.372 --> 17:22.124
Hey, baldy.

17:22.207 --> 17:24.793
How could you drag me
to that joke of a place!

17:24.877 --> 17:25.878
Come on now!

17:28.255 --> 17:30.716
You won't let it go, will you?

17:30.799 --> 17:34.428
You said you were willing
to give up your life to become stronger.

17:35.137 --> 17:36.680
My life I can give up...

17:38.223 --> 17:40.184
but not my manhood!

17:40.267 --> 17:41.268
Furry loafer!

17:42.269 --> 17:43.854
Please don't fight you two.

17:43.937 --> 17:45.189
Oh, the tragedy!

17:45.272 --> 17:47.941
Mr. Saotome, I can't bear this.

17:48.525 --> 17:51.445
Why did you risk such danger?

17:52.029 --> 17:53.405
There must have been a reason.

17:57.701 --> 18:00.746
"Nationwide Catalog
of Training Grounds in China"?

18:00.829 --> 18:02.790
It's a traveler's pamphlet
written in Chinese.

18:04.374 --> 18:05.584
Mr. Saotome...

18:05.667 --> 18:08.253
You can't read Chinese. Is that right?

18:08.837 --> 18:10.089
BINGO!

18:13.509 --> 18:16.637
I see. Hot water turns you back.

18:16.720 --> 18:19.431
Well, that was a little hot. I admit.

18:19.515 --> 18:24.061
Doused with cold water, you're a girl.
Pour hot water and you're a boy again.

18:24.144 --> 18:25.437
Not scalding hot water!

18:26.021 --> 18:28.774
Good, good. This isn't a big problem, no.

18:29.733 --> 18:31.652
<i>Oldest, Kasumi, 19.</i>

18:32.402 --> 18:34.446
<i>Second oldest, Nabiki, 17.</i>

18:35.114 --> 18:37.032
<i>Youngest, Akane, 16.</i>

18:37.533 --> 18:41.370
Go on, pick your favorite
and she will be your fiancée.

18:41.453 --> 18:42.996
- Akane then. It's decided.
- Huh?

18:43.080 --> 18:44.289
It's a perfect match.

18:44.373 --> 18:47.000
Who are you kidding? Why me?

18:47.084 --> 18:48.836
You hate boys, don't you?

18:48.919 --> 18:51.004
Lucky for you, he's half girl.

18:51.088 --> 18:53.090
This perv? No thanks!

18:53.757 --> 18:56.385
Hey! Who are you calling perv?

18:56.468 --> 18:58.095
You saw me naked.

18:58.178 --> 19:01.431
Listen here. I was the one bathing first.

19:01.515 --> 19:04.226
It's much worse when a girl is naked!

19:04.309 --> 19:06.895
They're getting along already.

19:06.979 --> 19:08.689
No, we're fighting!

19:09.606 --> 19:10.691
Anyhow, I...

19:11.358 --> 19:12.651
See you.

19:12.734 --> 19:14.945
Ranma, where are you going?

19:15.028 --> 19:16.196
I'm going back to China.

19:16.697 --> 19:19.199
I'm gonna find a way
to turn my body back to normal.

19:19.783 --> 19:21.160
I don't have time for this.

19:21.952 --> 19:23.036
I'll tell you this.

19:23.704 --> 19:25.914
We saw each other in the nude.

19:26.832 --> 19:30.419
Besides, I'm used
to seeing my own body.

19:30.502 --> 19:33.922
A woman in the nude
doesn't mean anything to me.

19:35.257 --> 19:38.552
Actually, my proportions
are much better than yours!

19:42.848 --> 19:45.142
Ranma, you brought this on yourself.

19:50.981 --> 19:52.649
You woke up.

19:52.733 --> 19:54.276
Ouch...

19:54.359 --> 19:55.360
Are you okay?

19:55.444 --> 19:56.528
Yeah.

19:56.612 --> 20:00.157
I'm sorry.
Please don't think badly of Akane.

20:00.240 --> 20:02.826
She's sincere at heart,

20:02.910 --> 20:05.162
but she's also helplessly violent.

20:05.245 --> 20:07.664
Kasumi, you're not helping.

20:10.876 --> 20:13.921
<i>What's his problem? He ridiculed me!</i>

20:14.004 --> 20:18.300
My proportions are better than yours!

20:19.218 --> 20:22.804
<i>I can't believe this guy. I'm fuming mad!</i>

20:25.390 --> 20:28.977
<i>Ouch, it still throbs.</i>

20:29.061 --> 20:30.520
<i>That girl is a monster.</i>

20:31.146 --> 20:32.397
Let's be friends.

20:33.106 --> 20:34.650
<i>After all that talk...</i>

20:35.734 --> 20:38.570
<i>She flipped on me
as soon as she found out that I'm a guy.</i>

20:42.074 --> 20:44.451
I don't ever want to be beaten by a boy.

20:50.249 --> 20:51.250
Whatever.

20:59.007 --> 21:01.134
This is...

21:01.218 --> 21:03.971
You degenerate!

21:11.728 --> 21:14.731
She's an energetic, cute fiancée.

21:14.815 --> 21:16.191
She isn't cute.

21:16.275 --> 21:18.860
Who cares? He was a girl.

21:18.944 --> 21:19.945
I care.

21:27.953 --> 21:31.248
There's nothing cute about her!

22:56.958 --> 23:01.963
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
